sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Service
    participant Kafka as foc.user.status
    participant Rating as Rating service
    participant DB as Postgres

    Note over User: six-month deletion period ends
    User->>Kafka: type UserDeleted, data.userId
    Kafka->>Rating: UserDeleted
    alt another type, e.g. UserVerified
        Rating-->>Kafka: ignored
    else UserDeleted
        Note over Rating,DB: one transaction
        Rating->>DB: insert deleted_user, conflict does nothing
        Rating->>DB: delete grants where the user is rater or ratee
        Rating->>DB: delete ratings the user received, and their user_rating
        Rating->>DB: set rater_id null on ratings the user gave
        Note over Rating,DB: other users' sums and counts unchanged, nothing published
    end
